### Exercise 1: Spot the Bug
Why does this instantiation fail compilation?
```java
public class Outer {
    public class Inner {}
}
public class Test {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Outer.Inner in = new Outer.Inner(); // COMPILE ERROR
    }
