### Exercise 1: Spot the Bug
Why does this `try-catch` sequence fail to compile?
```java
try {
    readFile();
} catch (Exception e) {
    System.out.println("Generic error");
} catch (IOException e) { // COMPILE ERROR
    System.out.println("I/O error");
