Max Heap Memory:     8,564,768,768 bytes (8168.0 MB)
Total Allocated:     12,582,912 bytes (12.0 MB)
Used Heap Memory:    1,467,584 bytes
Non-Heap (Metaspace): 2125 KB
Safely Measured Stack Frame Depth: 500
